---
---
<section class="py-24 bg-slate-50">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="text-center mb-16">
      <span class="text-primary font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase text-sm mb-2 block">Value Proposition</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Mengapa Memilih Hafshi Jaya Konveksi?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto">Kami berdedikasi memberikan kualitas dan layanan terbaik sebagai mitra produksi apparel andalan perusahaan Anda.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
      {/* Card 1 */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-50 text-primary rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4M7.835 4.697a3.42 3.42 0 001.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 014.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 001.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 013.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010 4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806 1.946 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138 3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-4.438 0 3.42 3.42 0 00-1.946-.806 3.42 3.42 0 01-3.138-3.138 3.42 3.42 0 00-.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 010-4.438 3.42 3.42 0 00.806-1.946 3.42 3.42 0 013.138-3.138z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Kualitas Standard Industri</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Jahitan rapi, presisi, dan menggunakan material terbaik sesuai spesifikasi yang disepakati.</p>
      </div>
      
      {/* Card 2 */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-amber-50 text-accent rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Garansi Tepat Waktu</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Komitmen penyelesaian produksi on-time dengan garansi perbaikan jika ada cacat produksi.</p>
      </div>
      
      {/* Card 3 */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Sampel & Mockup Gratis</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Dapatkan desain digital gratis dan sampel fisik sebelum produksi massal dimulai.</p>
      </div>
      
      {/* Card 4 */}
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-slate-100 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/40 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform duration-300">
        <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-50 text-purple-500 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 shadow-inner">
          <svg class="w-7 h-7" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path></svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">Workshop Transparan</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">Lokasi workshop jelas di Cilodong, Depok. Bebas berkunjung untuk mengecek produksi.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
